// Title: Imports Registry Key From a File
// ID: 73bba97f-a82d-42ce-b315-9182e76c57b1
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Oddvar Moe, Sander Wiebing, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-07
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
// Description: Detects the import of the specified file to the registry with regedit.exe.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((CommandLine CONTAINS " /i " OR CommandLine CONTAINS " /s " OR CommandLine CONTAINS ".reg")) AND ((Image ENDSWITH "\\regedit.exe") OR (OriginalFileName EQ "REGEDIT.EXE"))) AND NOT ((((CommandLine CONTAINS " -e " OR CommandLine CONTAINS " -a " OR CommandLine CONTAINS " -c ")) AND (CommandLine=regex(":[^ \\\\]")))))
